= Lyle Bristol

Bristol [? if heartland_leader = "Bristol": is ?][? if heartland_leader != "Bristol" : was ?] the Minister-President of Heartland, the largest state in the Commonwealth. He is a reformist leader who seeks to work with the bourgeois parties.

- @coalition
- @coalition_president
- @prussian_bulwark
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Bristol can improve our relationships with our centrist and center-right coalition partners in Heartland as well as in the Assembly.
view-if: president != "Bristol"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (marcher_heartland or in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or heartland_leader == "Bristol")
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not marcher_heartland : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> does not control the Heartland government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; unionist_relation += 4; ddp_relation += 4; gold_relation += 2; lvp_relation += 4; gold_relation += 2 if in_grand_coalition; gold_relation += 2 if in_grand_coalition_heartland; gold_left += 1 if in_grand_coalition_heartland; unionist_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; ddp_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; lvp_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; lvp_left += 0.5; ddp_left += 0.25;

We have improved our relations with the [? if in_grand_coalition : [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:, <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?], ?][? if not in_grand_coalition and not in_grand_coalition_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>,?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>,?]?][? if not in_grand_coalition and in_grand_coalition_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:, <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ?] and reduced tensions with the coalition. [? if marcher_heartland and not heartland_leader = "Bristol": Bristol's resignation from the head of the Heartland government has hindered this ability. ?]

@coalition_president
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Bristol can improve our relationships with our centrist and center-right coalition partners in the Assembly as President.
view-if: president == "Bristol"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; unionist_relation += 6; ddp_relation += 6; gold_relation += 4; lvp_relation += 6; gold_relation += 2 if in_grand_coalition; gold_relation += 2 if in_grand_coalition_heartland; gold_left += 1 if in_grand_coalition_heartland; unionist_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; ddp_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; lvp_relation += 2 if heartland_leader = "Bristol"; lvp_left += 0.5; ddp_left += 0.25;

We have improved our relations with the [? if in_grand_coalition : [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:, <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?], ?][? if not in_grand_coalition and not in_grand_coalition_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>,?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>,?]?][? if not in_grand_coalition and in_grand_coalition_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span>)?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Christian People's**</span> (<span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>)?] Party[? if not lvp_formed:, <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ?] and reduced tensions with the coalition. [? if marcher_heartland and not heartland_leader = "Bristol": Bristol's resignation from the head of the Heartland government has hindered this ability. ?]

@prussian_bulwark
title: The Heartland Bulwark
subtitle: As the Minister-President of Heartland, Bristol has power over the Heartland bureaucracy and security services.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and heartland_leader = "Bristol"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": Bristol doesn't control Heartland anymore. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; heartland_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: prussian_affairs if not in_grand_coalition_heartland and not in_marcher_majority_heartland; prussian_affairs_majority if in_marcher_majority_heartland; prussian_affairs_dvp if in_grand_coalition_heartland

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Bristol" and president != "Bristol" : Bristol must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if president = "Bristol" and presidential_powers : We have removed this power from the president with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Bristol" or (president == "Bristol" and not presidential_powers))
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; 

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
